# Souvenir stand awning (one-way; top 5 px = walking surface): a k-outlined
# o/O/l rod, wine-and-white canvas in 4 px vertical stripes (w with an i
# shadow under the rod, R - never Resi's r), a scalloped k-outlined lower
# edge (one tongue per stripe). End tiles: a 2 px R side flap with a k edge.
# Transparent below the scallops (the vendor stands in the gap under it).
# Autotiled (D-020): anim `auto`, frame = neighbour mask
# (1 = same tile above, 2 = right, 4 = below, 8 = left; level edge = same).
sprite = tile_standl_dach
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = auto frames=16 ticks=1
